00:01:52.440 --> 00:01:55.320
Oh, my gosh, like, what do
you love about drumming?

00:01:55.320 --> 00:01:58.620
- Well, what I love
about drumming is like,

00:01:58.620 --> 00:02:02.100
I love how it just, like, it
just comes from your heart,

00:02:02.100 --> 00:02:02.933
