00:02:02.933 --> 00:02:03.990
It just beats you up,

00:02:03.990 --> 00:02:06.307
and that's why it gives you
like the head bangs, you know?

00:02:06.307 --> 00:02:07.140
(audience laughs)

00:02:07.140 --> 00:02:08.710
And, it just like, it's crazy.

00:02:08.710 --> 00:02:11.460
- Oh, my gosh, I cannot wait to see

00:02:11.460 --> 00:02:12.540
where your life is headed.

00:02:12.540 --> 00:02:15.280
You are so, so cool. Oh, my gosh.

00:02:15.280 --> 00:02:18.480
Well, y'all have a big
gig next week, right?

00:02:18.480 --> 00:02:21.000
