00:02:28.920 --> 00:02:29.753
- Yeah.

00:02:29.753 --> 00:02:33.960
- Absolutely, Ryder, rock and
roll, little one. Oh, my gosh.

00:02:33.960 --> 00:02:36.570
Thank you so much Ryder,
and thank you Jason.

00:02:36.570 --> 00:02:38.280
Y'all have such a great
time at the Whisky.

00:02:38.280 --> 00:02:39.990
I'm liking your post right now, all right?

00:02:39.990 --> 00:02:42.003
- Yeah.
- Oh, I love that.

00:02:44.445 --> 00:02:47.700
- I'm actually recording
a live album there,

00:02:47.700 --> 00:02:49.731
my first album, live album.

00:02:49.731 --> 00:02:51.215
(audience cheers and applauds)

00:02:51.215 --> 00:02:55.383
- Oh, my God, that is so incredible.

00:02:55.383 --> 00:02:57.932
We're gonna have to get you
to play at some point, Ryder.

00:02:57.932 --> 00:03:01.410
Like, I'm gonna need to
feel that talent in person.

00:03:01.410 --> 00:03:02.730
All right, well, that's not all,

00:03:02.730 --> 00:03:04.530
actually our season
long partner Pilot Pen,

00:03:04.530 --> 00:03:06.150
makers of FriXion, the go to erasable pen

00:03:06.150 --> 00:03:07.110
